  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario de salud y bienestar**",
      "",
      "| Ámbito | Palabras clave |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| Síntomas | *exhausted, run down, dizzy, nauseous, a sore throat, a high temperature, a rash, aches and pains* |",
      "| Estrés | *stress, burnout, anxiety, panic attack, overwhelmed, under pressure, unwind* |",
      "| Hábitos | *balanced diet, junk food, sedentary lifestyle, workout, skip meals, get enough sleep* |",
      "| Prevención | *check-up, vaccination, screening, immune system, lifestyle change* |",
      "| Salud mental | *mental health, counselling, therapy, self-esteem, resilience, mindfulness* |",
      "",
      "**Colocaciones**",
      "",
      "- *catch a cold · come down with the flu · recover from an illness · suffer from anxiety · take medication · lose weight · put on weight · keep fit · stay in shape · give up smoking · cut down on sugar · take up a sport*.",
      "",
      "**Phrasal verbs de salud**",
      "",
      "- *come down with* (enfermar de) · *get over* (superar) · *pass out* (desmayarse) · *wear off* (pasarse el efecto) · *work out* (hacer ejercicio) · *cut down on* (reducir) · *give up* (dejar) · *take up* (empezar una afición).",
      "",
      "**Patrones con have trouble / difficulty**",
      "",
      "- *have trouble + -ing* → *I have trouble sleeping.* · *have difficulty + -ing* → *She has difficulty breathing.* · *It's worth + -ing* → *It's worth trying.*",
      "",
      "**Falsos amigos**",
      "",
      "- *Constipated* = estreñido (no 'constipado': *to have a cold*). · *Embarrassed* = avergonzado (no 'embarazada': *pregnant*). · *Sensitive* ≠ *sensible*. · *Medicine* = medicina/medicamento; *drug* = droga/fármaco.",
      "",
      "**Errores típicos**",
      "",
      "- ✘ *I am constipated, I have a cold* → ✔ *I've got a cold.* (constipated = estreñido).",
      "- ✘ *I have a pain in my head.* → ✔ *I have a headache.* / *I've got a pain in my chest.*",
      "- ✘ *I have trouble to sleep.* → ✔ *I have trouble sleeping.*",
      "- ✘ *It's worth to try.* → ✔ *It's worth trying.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** *advice* (incontable) y *health* sin plural: *good health*, *a piece of advice*. ✘ *an advice* → ✔ *a piece of advice*.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *anxious* /ˈæŋkʃəs/ · *therapist* /ˈθerəpɪst/ · *exhausted* /ɪɡˈzɔːstɪd/ · *medicine* /ˈmedsn/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "an advice",
        "right": "a piece of advice",
        "note": "Advice incontable."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I am constipated (cold)",
